{"id":"660866","name":"笋子炒梅花肉","author":"兰杏梅","authorId":"12270318","desc":"","cover":"images/660866/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"干笋子","amount":"一把"},{"name":"梅花肉","amount":"三两"}],"sub":[{"name":"姜","amount":"少许"},{"name":"葱","amount":"少许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"梅花肉备用。","img":"images/660866/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"干笋子温水浸泡一夜。","img":"images/660866/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"切丝，备用。","img":"images/660866/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"姜切丝，备用。","img":"images/660866/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"锅烧热放适量油，倒入梅花肉加适量盐和少许老抽煸炒，再倒入姜丝，翻炒一下，继续倒入笋子加南德调味，翻炒片刻即可。","img":"images/660866/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"出锅装盘。","img":"images/660866/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"撒上葱花点缀一下。","img":"images/660866/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"美味可口。","img":"images/660866/step_8.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}